# Reuse first

- Read the feature LLD **reuse map** before adding packages or services.
- Prefer extending existing modules, shared libs, and design-system primitives.
- New modules need a one-line justification in the story Notes or LLD.
- Do not duplicate utilities already in allowlisted paths.
- Web/mobile: compose FEAT-UI / token primitives — no one-off visual systems.
